      "text": "[ K-IG 교육- 024 ]"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Life at my House"
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "My parents always make my sister and I feel important and special."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "My parents love each other."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "They always have been a good example for us."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "My father is always helpful around the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "He often goes shopping with my mother. I look up to him."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "My mother is a very good cook, and is still a beautiful woman."
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "She looks younger than her age. I love my mother."
    },
